Central Tender Board. To carry out the objectives of this Order, there is hereby created a Central
Tender Board, which shall be composed of five (5) members as follows:
a) The Executive Director, Presidential Management Staff;
b) Representative of the National Economic and Development Authority;
c) Representative of the Ministry of the Budget;
d) Representative of the agency concerned; and
e) Another member to be appointed by the President of the Philippines, preferably a representative of the
Philippine Contractors Association.
The above members shall elect the Chairman who shall serve for a period of two years.
